  CellName: Rampage
  Description: Demolition arena cell - a belt of cacti, spires, rosettes, pines and
    coral ringing the membrane (planting shells at 0.76-0.94 of the membrane radius),
    seeded across all three domains so every pilot always has hostile mass to smash.
    The core is left open as the crystal's contested ground. Destruction is the active
    sink; flora regrowth below Frenzy keeps the belt stocked.
